{"version":"1.7","group":"V601","entries":[{"id":"learn:01803805-v","headword":"abase","group":"V601","partOfSpeech":"verb","itemIds":["JBKROW034466"],"localGlosses":["(지위를) 떨어뜨리다"],"definitionEn":"cause to feel shame; hurt the pride of","definitionKo":"수치심을 느끼게 하거나 자존심을 상하게 하다.","memoryKo":"사람의 자존감이나 지위를 아래로 낮춘다.","usageKo":"사람을 모욕하거나 비하해 위신과 자존심을 떨어뜨리는 상황에서 쓴다.","examTrapKo":"debase는 가치나 품질을 떨어뜨리는 데 널리 쓰이고, abase는 사람을 낮추고 모욕하는 뜻이 중심이다.","contrasts":[{"word":"debase","noteKo":"화폐·품질·가치·도덕적 수준 등을 떨어뜨리는 뜻으로도 쓰인다."}],"example":{"en":"The tyrant tried to abase his critics in public.","ko":"그 폭군은 공개적으로 비판자들을 비하하려 했다.","kind":"editorial"},"audio":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/60/En-us-abase.ogg/En-us-abase.ogg.mp3","region":"US","source":"Wikimedia Commons","sourcePage":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:En-us-abase.ogg","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","attribution":"Dvortygirl"},"nuance":{},"sources":[{"name":"Open English WordNet","url":"https://en-word.net/downloads/english-wordnet-2025-json.zip","license":"CC BY 4.0","edition":"2025","attribution":"Princeton WordNet; Open English WordNet Team"},{"name":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki","url":"https://kaikki.org/dictionary/English/meaning/a/ab/abase.jsonl","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0 / GFDL 1.3","edition":"accessed 2026.09.04"}],"verification":{"status":"cross-agreed","reviewer":"Codex editorial cross-check","checkedAtKst":"2026.09.04","evidence":[{"source":"Open English WordNet 2025","independenceGroup":"WordNet","url":"https://en-word.net/downloads/english-wordnet-2025-json.zip","result":"agree","contentSha256":"7d749f6e2c39e6970e4997839dcf6e42fd281f3c2fae0171d2192bae8cfa4b51"},{"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki","independenceGroup":"Wiktionary","url":"https://kaikki.org/dictionary/English/meaning/a/ab/abase.jsonl","result":"agree","contentSha256":"8149ca04ace07b7e59af4bcdf8f84eb7cd871898bb1c2f6e19ff4e8061d49d74"}]}},{"id":"learn:01796126-v","headword":"abash","group":"V601","partOfSpeech":"verb","itemIds":["JBKROW034467"],"localGlosses":["얼굴을 붉히게 하다"],"definitionEn":"cause to be embarrassed; cause to feel self-conscious","definitionKo":"당황하게 하거나 자의식을 느끼게 하다.","memoryKo":"갑자기 얼굴이 붉어지고 몸 둘 바를 모르게 만든다.","usageKo":"실수나 열등감 등을 의식하게 만들어 순간적으로 부끄럽고 당황하게 할 때 쓴다.","examTrapKo":"강한 공개적 모욕을 뜻하는 humiliate보다, 당황하여 평정심을 잃는 느낌에 가깝다.","contrasts":[{"word":"humiliate","noteKo":"사람의 존엄이나 자존심을 심하게 깎아내리는 뜻이 강하다."}],"example":{"en":"The unexpected question did not abash her.","ko":"그 뜻밖의 질문도 그녀를 당황하게 하지 못했다.","kind":"editorial"},"audio":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/ba/En-us-abash.ogg/En-us-abash.ogg.mp3","region":"US","source":"Wikimedia Commons","sourcePage":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:En-us-abash.ogg","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","attribution":"Dvortygirl"},"nuance":{},"sources":[{"name":"Open English WordNet","url":"https://en-word.net/downloads/english-wordnet-2025-json.zip","license":"CC BY 4.0","edition":"2025","attribution":"Princeton WordNet; Open English WordNet Team"},{"name":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki","url":"https://kaikki.org/dictionary/English/meaning/a/ab/abash.jsonl","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0 / GFDL 1.3","edition":"accessed 2026.09.04"}],"verification":{"status":"cross-agreed","reviewer":"Codex editorial cross-check","checkedAtKst":"2026.09.04","evidence":[{"source":"Open English WordNet 2025","independenceGroup":"WordNet","url":"https://en-word.net/downloads/english-wordnet-2025-json.zip","result":"agree","contentSha256":"7d749f6e2c39e6970e4997839dcf6e42fd281f3c2fae0171d2192bae8cfa4b51"},{"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki","independenceGroup":"Wiktionary","url":"https://kaikki.org/dictionary/English/meaning/a/ab/abash.jsonl","result":"agree","contentSha256":"59b7295253db3dae00f8b16ab294bfb567898f2a87f89c45017d3090a06d5722"}]}},{"id":"learn:02384340-v","headword":"abdicate","group":"V601","partOfSpeech":"verb","itemIds":["JBKROW034468"],"localGlosses":["포기하다"],"definitionEn":"give up, such as power, as of monarchs and emperors, or duties and obligations","definitionKo":"군주가 권력을 내려놓듯, 권한·직위·의무나 책임을 포기하다.","memoryKo":"왕좌에서 스스로 내려오는 장면이 중심 이미지다.","usageKo":"왕위나 높은 직위를 공식적으로 내려놓거나, 비유적으로 책임을 저버릴 때 쓴다.","examTrapKo":"일반 직장을 그만두는 resign보다 군주권·고위 권력 또는 중대한 책임의 포기가 두드러진다.","contrasts":[{"word":"resign","noteKo":"직위나 직장을 사임한다는 일반적인 표현이다."}],"example":{"en":"The King abdicated when he married a divorcee","ko":"그 왕은 이혼 경력이 있는 사람과 결혼하면서 왕위에서 물러났다.","kind":"source"},"nuance":{},"sources":[{"name":"Open English WordNet","url":"https://en-word.net/downloads/english-wordnet-2025-json.zip","license":"CC BY 4.0","edition":"2025","attribution":"Princeton WordNet; Open English WordNet Team"},{"name":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki","url":"https://kaikki.org/dictionary/English/meaning/a/ab/abdicate.jsonl","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0 / GFDL 1.3","edition":"accessed 2026.09.04"}],"verification":{"status":"cross-agreed","reviewer":"Codex editorial cross-check","checkedAtKst":"2026.09.04","evidence":[{"source":"Open English WordNet 2025","independenceGroup":"WordNet","url":"https://en-word.net/downloads/english-wordnet-2025-json.zip","result":"agree","contentSha256":"7d749f6e2c39e6970e4997839dcf6e42fd281f3c2fae0171d2192bae8cfa4b51"},{"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki","independenceGroup":"Wiktionary","url":"https://kaikki.org/dictionary/English/meaning/a/ab/abdicate.jsonl","result":"agree","contentSha256":"19e0853b85fcc29307ecc3ba2e525b42218c7d11252e6acba8fda43b367b3075"}]}},{"id":"learn:09229873-n","headword":"acclivity","group":"V601","partOfSpeech":"noun","itemIds":["JBKROW001773","JBKROW002069","JBKROW004090","JBKROW034478"],"localGlosses":["오르막 경사"],"definitionEn":"an upward slope or grade (as in a road)","definitionKo":"도로 등에서 위로 올라가는 경사 또는 오르막.","memoryKo":"올라가는 경사에는 acclivity, 내려가는 경사에는 declivity다.","usageKo":"지형이나 도로가 위쪽으로 기울어진 경사를 가리키는 명사다.","examTrapKo":"반대 방향의 내리막을 뜻하는 declivity와 방향을 바꾸어 출제하기 쉽다.","contrasts":[{"word":"declivity","noteKo":"아래쪽으로 내려가는 경사나 내리막을 뜻한다."}],"example":{"en":"The steep acclivity slowed the hikers.","ko":"가파른 오르막 경사가 등산객들의 속도를 늦췄다.","kind":"editorial"},"nuance":{},"sources":[{"name":"Open English WordNet","url":"https://en-word.net/downloads/english-wordnet-2025-json.zip","license":"CC BY 4.0","edition":"2025","attribution":"Princeton WordNet; Open English WordNet Team"},{"name":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki","url":"https://kaikki.org/dictionary/English/meaning/a/ac/acclivity.jsonl","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0 / GFDL 1.3","edition":"accessed 2026.09.04"}],"verification":{"status":"cross-agreed","reviewer":"Codex editorial cross-check","checkedAtKst":"2026.09.04","evidence":[{"source":"Open English WordNet 2025","independenceGroup":"WordNet","url":"https://en-word.net/downloads/english-wordnet-2025-json.zip","result":"agree","contentSha256":"7d749f6e2c39e6970e4997839dcf6e42fd281f3c2fae0171d2192bae8cfa4b51"},{"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki","independenceGroup":"Wiktionary","url":"https://kaikki.org/dictionary/English/meaning/a/ac/acclivity.jsonl","result":"agree","contentSha256":"6fa072a5c4ff695182fad86f23ed0620c3a08a99188cededfcea72a59af6a42a"}]}},{"id":"learn:02347012-v","headword":"accouter","group":"V601","partOfSpeech":"verb","itemIds":["JBKROW034480"],"localGlosses":["장비를 갖추다"],"definitionEn":"provide with military equipment","definitionKo":"군사 장비를 지급하거나 갖추게 하다.","memoryKo":"군인을 전투 장비로 차려 입히는 장면을 떠올린다.","usageKo":"특히 군인이나 부대에 복장과 장비를 갖추어 줄 때 쓰는 동사다.","examTrapKo":"일반적인 equip보다 군복·무기 등 군사 장비의 맥락이 뚜렷하다.","contrasts":[{"word":"equip","noteKo":"목적에 필요한 장비를 갖추게 한다는 일반적인 표현이다."}],"example":{"en":"The recruits were accoutered for field training.","ko":"신병들은 야외 훈련에 필요한 군사 장비를 갖추었다.","kind":"editorial"},"nuance":{},"sources":[{"name":"Open English WordNet","url":"https://en-word.net/downloads/english-wordnet-2025-json.zip","license":"CC BY 4.0","edition":"2025","attribution":"Princeton WordNet; Open English WordNet Team"},{"name":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki","url":"https://kaikki.org/dictionary/English/meaning/a/ac/accouter.jsonl","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0 / GFDL 1.3","edition":"accessed 2026.09.04"}],"verification":{"status":"cross-agreed","reviewer":"Codex editorial cross-check","checkedAtKst":"2026.09.04","evidence":[{"source":"Open English WordNet 2025","independenceGroup":"WordNet","url":"https://en-word.net/downloads/english-wordnet-2025-json.zip","result":"agree","contentSha256":"7d749f6e2c39e6970e4997839dcf6e42fd281f3c2fae0171d2192bae8cfa4b51"},{"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki","independenceGroup":"Wiktionary","url":"https://kaikki.org/dictionary/English/meaning/a/ac/accouter.jsonl","result":"agree","contentSha256":"7161a8e5a2096376941869a5ad525c32b2807cb92781e570b6007dca27995091"}]}}]}
